{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"提摩太前書","commonName":"提摩太前書","title":"提摩太前書","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1822fdddb64d09dc14c1e74356eb9c5a0d478ee65d890e82de816027d13aa2d2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["監督與執事的資格"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「人若渴望做教會的監督，就是在愛慕尊貴的工作。」這句話千真萬確。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["作監督的人必須無可指責，只有一位妻子，為人節制自律、受人尊敬、樂於接待客旅、善於教導、"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["待人溫和，不酗酒、不好鬥、不爭吵、不貪財，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["善於管理自己的家，受兒女的敬重和孝順。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["一個人要是不懂得管理自己的家，又怎能照顧上帝的教會呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["初信主的人不可作監督，免得他自高自大，遭受魔鬼所受的懲罰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["作監督的在教會以外也必須有好名聲，以免被人指責，陷入魔鬼的圈套。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["同樣，做執事的也要品行端正，說話誠實，不好酒，不貪財，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要存著清潔的良心持守奧妙的真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們要先接受考驗，倘若無可指責，就可以立他們為執事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["執事的妻子",{"noteId":1},"也要品行端正，不搬弄是非，為人節制，做事忠心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["執事只能有一位妻子，他要管好自己的兒女和自己的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["盡忠職守的執事能得到好聲譽，也會對基督耶穌有堅定的信心。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["奧妙無比的信仰"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我希望能儘快去你那裡，但還是先寫信告訴你這些事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["這樣，如果我行期延誤，你也可以知道在上帝的家中該怎麼做。這家是永活上帝的教會，是真理的柱石和根基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["毫無疑問，我們偉大的信仰奧妙無比：",{"text":"祂以肉身顯現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被聖靈證明為義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被天使看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被傳揚到列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被世人信奉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被接到天上的榮耀中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「執事的妻子」或譯「女執事」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}